    title: 'How Product Reviews Increase Conversion by 270%',
    subtitle: 'The psychology of social proof — and a practical playbook for collecting more reviews.',
    description: 'Data-backed guide on how product reviews impact conversion rates for Indian ecommerce, with a step-by-step collection playbook.',
