    title: 'Building Your First LetBuyy App',
    subtitle: 'From OAuth to your first embedded app in the Merchant Control Plane.',
    description: 'Step-by-step guide to building a LetBuyy App — OAuth 2.0, embedded UI, webhooks, and submitting to the App Marketplace.',
    author: 'arjun-developer',
